// The witness's run reaches main: its 1063 steps by evaluation (each
// instruction decoded and executed on the concrete state; set_tid_address's
// thread id a picked witness) -- about 40 s, its own file for the cache.
theorem wit.run: ex m. runs(claim_malloc.run_until(musl_malloc.main_at), wit.m0, ok(m, empty))
proof
  show by eval()
qed
